        "definition" : [ "An enzymatic digest of meat, used for the culturing of microorganisms." ],
        "definition source" : [ "From BD Bionutrients Technical Manual (3rd edition revised):\n\nBacto™ Neopeptone is an enzymatic digest of protein. Neopeptone contains a wide variety of peptide sizes in combination with vitamins, nucleotides and minerals.\n\nAsh content is 6.9%\nNaCl content is 1.4%" ]
